#. type: Title =
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenEMS: JSON-RPC"
msgstr "OpenEMS: JSON-RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"JSON-RPC is the **common “language”** that the parts of OpenEMS use to talk "
"to each other: the web interface with the system, the system with the "
"backend, and third-party systems (e.g. a home automation system) with the "
"system. If you only operate OpenEMS via the web interface, you will not come "
"into contact with it. It becomes interesting when you want to query values "
"from your own programs or control the system."
msgstr ""
"JSON-RPC ist die **gemeinsame „Sprache“**, in der sich die Teile von OpenEMS "
"unterhalten: die Weboberfläche mit der Anlage, die Anlage mit dem Backend "
"und Fremdsysteme (z. B. eine Hausautomation) mit der Anlage. Wer OpenEMS nur "
"über die Weboberfläche bedient, kommt damit nicht in Berührung. Interessant "
"wird es, wenn man Werte aus eigenen Programmen abfragen oder die Anlage "
"steuern möchte."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "The principle"
msgstr "Das Prinzip"

#. type: #sec-the-principle
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid "Each message is a small text in JSON format. There are three types:"
msgstr ""
"Jede Nachricht ist ein kleiner Text im JSON-Format. Es gibt drei Arten:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type\n"
"| Meaning\n"
"| Example\n"
"\n"
"| **Request**\n"
"| “Please do something or give me something.”\n"
"| “Give me the configuration.”\n"
"| **Response**\n"
"| Result or error message for a request\n"
"| the configuration\n"
"| **Notification**\n"
"| Message without a response\n"
"| “Here are the current measured values.”\n"
msgstr ""
"| Art\n"
"| Bedeutung\n"
"| Beispiel\n"
"\n"
"| **Anfrage**\n"
"| „Bitte tu etwas oder gib mir etwas.“\n"
"| „Gib mir die Konfiguration.“\n"
"| **Antwort**\n"
"| Ergebnis oder Fehlermeldung zu einer Anfrage\n"
"| die Konfiguration\n"
"| **Mitteilung**\n"
"| Nachricht ohne Antwort\n"
"| „Hier sind die aktuellen Messwerte.“\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid "A request looks like this, for example:"
msgstr "Eine Anfrage sieht zum Beispiel so aus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"1\", \"method\": \"getEdgeConfig\", \"params\": {}}\n"
msgstr "{\"jsonrpc\": \"2.0\", \"id\": \"1\", \"method\": \"getEdgeConfig\", \"params\": {}}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid "`+method+` says **what** is wanted."
msgstr "`+method+` sagt, **was** gewünscht ist."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid "`+params+` contains the details."
msgstr "`+params+` enthält die Angaben dazu."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"`+id+` is a freely chosen identifier. The response carries the same `+id+`."
msgstr ""
"`+id+` ist eine frei gewählte Kennung. Die Antwort trägt dieselbe `+id+`."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Which routes"
msgstr "Über welche Wege"

#. type: #sec-which-routes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid "The same requests work via different routes:"
msgstr "Dieselben Anfragen funktionieren über verschiedene Wege:"

#. type: #sec-which-routes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"**xref:user/external-interfaces/websocket.adoc[Websocket]** – the permanent "
"connection of the web interface, with live values."
msgstr ""
"**xref:user/external-interfaces/websocket.adoc[Websocket]** – die dauerhafte "
"Verbindung der Weboberfläche, mit Live-Werten."

#. type: #sec-which-routes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"**xref:user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc[REST/HTTP]** – individual "
"calls, ideal for scripts and home automation."
msgstr ""
"**xref:user/external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc[REST/HTTP]** – einzelne "
"Aufrufe, ideal für Skripte und Hausautomation."

#. type: #sec-which-routes
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"**Backend** – remote access via the central server (see xref:user/cloud-"
"interfaces/backend-data-transfer.adoc[Data transfer to the backend])."
msgstr ""
"**Backend** – Fernzugriff über den zentralen Server (siehe xref:user/cloud-"
"interfaces/backend-data-transfer.adoc[Datenübertragung zum Backend])."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "What you can do with it"
msgstr "Was man damit tun kann"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Task\n"
"| Request\n"
"| Required role\n"
"\n"
"| View configuration and all value names\n"
"| `+getEdgeConfig+`\n"
"| Guest\n"
"| Retrieve histories (e.g. power over the day)\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesData+`\n"
"| logged in\n"
"| Retrieve energy amounts (e.g. purchased today)\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesEnergy+`\n"
"| logged in\n"
"| Export history as Excel\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesExportXlxs+`\n"
"| logged in\n"
"| Change a setting permanently\n"
"| `+updateComponentConfig+`\n"
"| Owner\n"
"| Retrieve schedule\n"
"| `+getSchedule+` to `+_energy+`\n"
"| –\n"
msgstr ""
"| Aufgabe\n"
"| Anfrage\n"
"| nötige Rolle\n"
"\n"
"| Konfiguration und alle Werte-Namen ansehen\n"
"| `+getEdgeConfig+`\n"
"| Gast\n"
"| Verläufe abrufen (z. B. Leistung über den Tag)\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesData+`\n"
"| angemeldet\n"
"| Energiemengen abrufen (z. B. Bezug heute)\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesEnergy+`\n"
"| angemeldet\n"
"| Historie als Excel exportieren\n"
"| `+queryHistoricTimeseriesExportXlxs+`\n"
"| angemeldet\n"
"| Eine Einstellung dauerhaft ändern\n"
"| `+updateComponentConfig+`\n"
"| Eigentümer\n"
"| Fahrplan abrufen\n"
"| `+getSchedule+` an `+_energy+`\n"
"| –\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"“Logged in” means: the source code does not require a specific role. Via "
"REST, however, a login is always necessary, because REST checks the user "
"name and password with every request."
msgstr ""
"„Angemeldet“ heißt: Der Quellcode verlangt keine bestimmte Rolle. Über REST "
"ist trotzdem immer eine Anmeldung nötig, weil REST bei jeder Anfrage "
"Benutzername und Passwort prüft."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"Some functions offer their own requests, e.g. the xref:user/schedule/"
"overview.adoc[schedule] or the app center. Such requests are sent “wrapped” "
"to the respective function (`+componentJsonApi+` with the ID of the "
"function)."
msgstr ""
"Manche Funktionen bieten eigene Anfragen an, z. B. der xref:user/schedule/"
"overview.adoc[Fahrplan] oder das App Center. Solche Anfragen werden "
"„verpackt“ an die jeweilige Funktion geschickt (`+componentJsonApi+` mit der "
"ID der Funktion)."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "User roles"
msgstr "Benutzerrollen"

#. type: #sec-user-roles
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"Each request runs on behalf of a logged-in user. OpenEMS has four roles:"
msgstr ""
"Jede Anfrage läuft im Namen eines angemeldeten Benutzers. OpenEMS kennt vier "
"Rollen:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role\n"
"| for\n"
"| may, among other things\n"
"\n"
"| Guest (GUEST)\n"
"| Viewers\n"
"| view values and histories\n"
"| Owner (OWNER)\n"
"| System operators\n"
"| additionally change settings\n"
"| Installer (INSTALLER)\n"
"| Specialist companies\n"
"| additionally see, install and remove certain apps in the app center\n"
"| Admin (ADMIN)\n"
"| Manufacturer / developer\n"
"| everything\n"
msgstr ""
"| Rolle\n"
"| für\n"
"| darf u. a.\n"
"\n"
"| Gast (GUEST)\n"
"| Zuschauer\n"
"| Werte und Verläufe ansehen\n"
"| Eigentümer (OWNER)\n"
"| Anlagenbetreiber\n"
"| zusätzlich Einstellungen ändern\n"
"| Installateur (INSTALLER)\n"
"| Fachbetrieb\n"
"| zusätzlich bestimmte Apps im App Center sehen, installieren und entfernen\n"
"| Admin (ADMIN)\n"
"| Hersteller / Entwickler\n"
"| alles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"Details for the web interface are on the xref:user/external-interfaces/"
"websocket.adoc[Websocket] page."
msgstr ""
"Details für die Weboberfläche stehen auf der Seite xref:user/external-"
"interfaces/websocket.adoc[Websocket]."

#. type: #sec-good-to-know
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"**Changing a setting is not the same as setting a control value.** A setting "
"is stored permanently. A control value only applies temporarily and must be "
"sent again regularly. See xref:user/external-interfaces/rest-"
"control.adoc[Control via REST/JSON]."
msgstr ""
"**Einstellung ändern ist nicht dasselbe wie Steuerwert setzen.** Eine "
"Einstellung wird dauerhaft gespeichert. Ein Steuerwert gilt nur "
"vorübergehend und muss regelmäßig neu gesendet werden. Siehe xref:user/"
"external-interfaces/rest-control.adoc[Steuern über REST/JSON]."

#. type: #sec-good-to-know
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/external-interfaces/json-rpc.adoc
msgid ""
"Do not change settings every minute: in the long term, this puts a strain on "
"the memory of the device (see xref:user/external-interfaces/"
"websocket.adoc#sec-note-do-not-write-the-configuration-frequently[Note])."
msgstr ""
"Einstellungen nicht im Minutentakt ändern: Das belastet auf Dauer den "
"Speicher des Geräts (siehe xref:user/external-interfaces/websocket.adoc#sec-"
"note-do-not-write-the-configuration-frequently[Hinweis])."
